<title>USA: L. Luria names Rachmil Lekach as CEO.</title>
<headline>L. Luria names Rachmil Lekach as CEO.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI LAKES, Fla. 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>L. Luria &amp; Son Inc said Friday its board had elected its chairman, Rachmil Lekach, as chief executive officer.  </p>
<p>The company, a jewelry and gift retailer, said Lekach would succeed Gerald Nathanson, who resigned for personal reasons.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
